exit: 1
--- stdout
+ environments release
    name: (absent) -> "release"
    reviewers: (absent) -> [{"type":"Team","slug":"justice-league"}]
    deployment_branch_policy: (absent) -> {"protected_branches":false,"custom_branch_policies":true}
    branch_policies: (absent) -> [{"name":"v*","type":"tag"}]
~ environments staging
    wait_timer: 30 -> 10
    prevent_self_review: false -> true
    reviewers: [{"type":"User","login":"octocat"},{"type":"Team","slug":"justice-league"}] -> [{"type":"User","login":"octocat"}]
    branch_policies: [{"name":"main","type":"branch"},{"name":"release/*","type":"branch"}] -> [{"name":"main","type":"branch"}]
! environments staging: secret GIST_ID
    note: present and not declared; repo-standard never deletes a secret, so declare it or remove it by hand
3 differences: 1 to create, 1 to update, 0 to delete, 1 repo-standard cannot change.
--- stderr
